      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fef07213946825cdd21544d5f32017e08606260c9057e240ac278a95dc4fa61d"
      ],
      "text": "Every handoff between agents goes through a file on disk, which the README says makes runs recoverable, auditable, and reusable across projects."
    },
