        "slc_211f3c8caf558ec56cd25872cd983ac171b80c4ed26580b62e8ac3062872002a"
      ],
      "text": "The README documents an optional claude-ds wrapper that runs Claude Code against DeepSeek's Anthropic-compatible API endpoint using DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, with deepseek-v4-pro and deepseek-v4-flash model mappings."
    },
